(5081749, 741487, 70265, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy your set-up. It looks like you took some time to plan this out. The background is fitting, and the props add a lot. If you had diffused the flash a bit, I think it would''ve been even better. My husband made a cheap flash diffuser using a small piece of plastic milk carton. Sounds crazy but it works great! You can find out how online. :) Commenting only.</td>', 'I really enjoy your set-up. It looks like you took some time to plan this out. The background is fitting, and the props add a lot. If you had diffused the flash a bit, I think it would''ve been even better. My husband made a cheap flash diffuser using a small piece of plastic milk carton. Sounds crazy but it works great! You can find out how online. :) Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081751, 741487, 100393, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment, nice sky - but the combination of the harsh flash and the white socks is just too distracting.</td>', 'Nice sentiment, nice sky - but the combination of the harsh flash and the white socks is just too distracting.', '2008-11-24 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081754, 741476, 100773, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that the photo is tilting a bit to the right, but I''m not sure. However, if it does, then I find that a bit disturbing. I''ll give you a 10 anyway, this being a photo I can''t seem to stop looking at. Beautifully shot. But still... Is it straight?</td>', 'It seems to me that the photo is tilting a bit to the right, but I''m not sure. However, if it does, then I find that a bit disturbing. I''ll give you a 10 anyway, this being a photo I can''t seem to stop looking at. Beautifully shot. But still... Is it straight?', '2008-11-24 14:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081755, 741314, 70265, '<td valign="top">I wish ''bench'' were more prominent ... because there is so much to love about this shot, but I''m afraid you''ll get scored down for that (but I hope not). What do I like? The colors especially, the set-up, the composition, the clarity &amp; patterns, the subtle vignette ... yes, challenge aside, it''s a wonderful shot unto itself! Commenting only.</td>', 'I wish ''bench'' were more prominent ... because there is so much to love about this shot, but I''m afraid you''ll get scored down for that (but I hope not). What do I like? The colors especially, the set-up, the composition, the clarity & patterns, the subtle vignette ... yes, challenge aside, it''s a wonderful shot unto itself! Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081756, 741089, 100393, '<td valign="top">This subject has quite a lot of potential but needs quite a lot more attention to bring it out.</td>', 'This subject has quite a lot of potential but needs quite a lot more attention to bring it out.', '2008-11-24 14:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081757, 741154, 70265, '<td valign="top">the soft pastels are really pretty. Commenting only.</td>', 'the soft pastels are really pretty. Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081758, 741446, 70265, '<td valign="top">Wow! How''d you do it? If this is done within advanced, I can''t figure out how you achieved the sparks, that little pup can''t be that strong. ... Brilliant! Commenting only.</td>', 'Wow! How''d you do it? If this is done within advanced, I can''t figure out how you achieved the sparks, that little pup can''t be that strong. ... Brilliant! Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081759, 740639, 70265, '<td valign="top">Love it because it could tell a hundred stories ... Commenting only.</td>', 'Love it because it could tell a hundred stories ... Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081760, 741350, 70265, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this was a set-up or not, but either way, brilliant. Commenting only.</td>', 'Can''t tell if this was a set-up or not, but either way, brilliant. Commenting only.', '2008-11-24 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081761, 741431, 100773, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot! Birds make for just as good models as practice!</td>', 'Beautifully shot! Birds make for just as good models as practice!', '2008-11-24 14:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081763, 740473, 100393, '<td valign="top">Well executed - I really like the color and lighting but I think the pose looks too odd to work.</td>', 'Well executed - I really like the color and lighting but I think the pose looks too odd to work.', '2008-11-24 14:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081765, 741440, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the houses in the background distract the eye. I like everything else though.</td>', 'I think the houses in the background distract the eye. I like everything else though.', '2008-11-24 14:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081769, 741057, 100393, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but given how saturated the green is, I think I''d have been tempted to balance is with a change of hue of the red to make it a bit more primary. As it is, I think it looks a bit odd. No doubt it is a good image though.</td>', 'I like the composition but given how saturated the green is, I think I''d have been tempted to balance is with a change of hue of the red to make it a bit more primary. As it is, I think it looks a bit odd. No doubt it is a good image though.', '2008-11-24 14:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5081771, 741436, 100393, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know you were allowed to use vignettes - I''d have thought that would be classed as creating a ''new feature''. I do think it has added to the image though and I think it works. I do like the image.</td>', 'I didn''t know you were allowed to use vignettes - I''d have thought that would be classed as creating a ''new feature''. I do think it has added to the image though and I think it works. I do like the image.', '2008-11-24 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1);
