(5082005, 741436, 75532, '<td valign="top">the bench seems out of focus around the legs wish it were a little sharper, but I really love the black against the red, and the shapes on the metal frame.  The cobble floor works great for this image. 7</td>', 'the bench seems out of focus around the legs wish it were a little sharper, but I really love the black against the red, and the shapes on the metal frame.  The cobble floor works great for this image. 7', '2008-11-24 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
