(5082160, 741440, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty place to sit, but I wouldn''t want to see so much of the houses past the pond.  A shallower DOF would bring more emphasis to the bench, tree and water, which would work better IMO.  Also the horizon looks slightly tilted; if that''s not intentional you might want to do a slight rotation to straighten the image.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty place to sit, but I wouldn''t want to see so much of the houses past the pond.  A shallower DOF would bring more emphasis to the bench, tree and water, which would work better IMO.  Also the horizon looks slightly tilted; if that''s not intentional you might want to do a slight rotation to straighten the image.', '2008-11-24 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5082172, 741400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very solid bench and very cooperative model.  There is a lot here and I would prefer some differentiation with lighting and/or DOF to give it some depth.</td>', 'Very solid bench and very cooperative model.  There is a lot here and I would prefer some differentiation with lighting and/or DOF to give it some depth.', '2008-11-24 17:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
