(5082214, 741423, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awful lot of graffiti''d benches in this challenge!  I like the exposure and those lovely starry lights.  For this challenge I think I''d prefer that the fence/rail next to the water be a less prominent part of the composition, so maybe a perspective more to the right of this one, facing at more of an angle to the tall building?  But then you lose the graffiti.  Tough one.</td>', 'Awful lot of graffiti''d benches in this challenge!  I like the exposure and those lovely starry lights.  For this challenge I think I''d prefer that the fence/rail next to the water be a less prominent part of the composition, so maybe a perspective more to the right of this one, facing at more of an angle to the tall building?  But then you lose the graffiti.  Tough one.', '2008-11-24 17:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
