(5083189, 741438, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the composition; the diagonals add a lot to it and the tree has a classic mature look to it.  Nice processing for a timeless sort of feeling, though in places it looks unnatural to me (for instance there is detail on the lower part of the tree trunk but everything else in that area is quite blurred, where I expect everything that distance from the camera to be pretty much equally blurred).</td>', 'I like the composition; the diagonals add a lot to it and the tree has a classic mature look to it.  Nice processing for a timeless sort of feeling, though in places it looks unnatural to me (for instance there is detail on the lower part of the tree trunk but everything else in that area is quite blurred, where I expect everything that distance from the camera to be pretty much equally blurred).', '2008-11-25 07:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083190, 741435, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely view and nice soft pastels.</td>', 'Lovely view and nice soft pastels.', '2008-11-25 07:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083295, 741397, 98986, '<td valign="top">good job. It''s a nice photo, but it;s not my favorite</td>', 'good job. It''s a nice photo, but it;s not my favorite', '2008-11-25 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083391, 741314, 66709, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.', '2008-11-25 11:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083392, 741248, 66709, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.', '2008-11-25 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083394, 741376, 66709, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be anything here to hold ones interest.', '2008-11-25 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083409, 741083, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed but too much sharpening gives the girl a halo.</td>', 'Nicely framed but too much sharpening gives the girl a halo.', '2008-11-25 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083427, 741350, 94815, '<td valign="top">Great image and my top pick. The processing mars it a bit because of the sharpening halo around the foreground figure and background dome. Otherwise great work.</td>', 'Great image and my top pick. The processing mars it a bit because of the sharpening halo around the foreground figure and background dome. Otherwise great work.', '2008-11-25 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083431, 741446, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Must have been a lot of work nicely done. But why the washed out color? Better in bw.</td>', 'Very funny. Must have been a lot of work nicely done. But why the washed out color? Better in bw.', '2008-11-25 12:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083433, 740841, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bw manages to avoid the pitfalls of excessive pp.</td>', 'Beautiful bw manages to avoid the pitfalls of excessive pp.', '2008-11-25 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083435, 740987, 94815, '<td valign="top">Odd points of view can seem mannered but this one works well. I like the competing natural and man made patterns.</td>', 'Odd points of view can seem mannered but this one works well. I like the competing natural and man made patterns.', '2008-11-25 12:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083505, 741282, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like how sunny it looks there. I think the focus could use sharpening.</td>', 'I like how sunny it looks there. I think the focus could use sharpening.', '2008-11-25 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083509, 741444, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the color choices and the contrast. I''d like to see a version without the person.</td>', 'I like the color choices and the contrast. I''d like to see a version without the person.', '2008-11-25 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083510, 741375, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the setting. I think the lighting feels a bit harsh - I think there''s a flash shadow under her arm?</td>', 'I like the setting. I think the lighting feels a bit harsh - I think there''s a flash shadow under her arm?', '2008-11-25 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083511, 741248, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. I think the cathedral feels a little flat, I wish we could see a little more of the side of it, but as you couldn''t control where the bench was I''m not sure if you could have change that at all.</td>', 'I like the perspective. I think the cathedral feels a little flat, I wish we could see a little more of the side of it, but as you couldn''t control where the bench was I''m not sure if you could have change that at all.', '2008-11-25 13:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5083512, 741228, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, I think I''d like it more with a little more contrast.</td>', 'I like the subject, I think I''d like it more with a little more contrast.', '2008-11-25 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
