(5086996, 741334, 97284, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2008-11-27 03:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086998, 740841, 97284, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective in this shot.  Nice contrast and composition</td>', 'Love the perspective in this shot.  Nice contrast and composition', '2008-11-27 03:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5086999, 740782, 97284, '<td valign="top">My Favorite so far.  Nice capture</td>', 'My Favorite so far.  Nice capture', '2008-11-27 03:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087003, 741448, 97284, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo...nice composition, very artistic and architectural</td>', 'Very cool photo...nice composition, very artistic and architectural', '2008-11-27 03:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087006, 741453, 97284, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of this challenge!  Love the rustic feel, the colors, the creativity/composition.</td>', 'One of my favorites of this challenge!  Love the rustic feel, the colors, the creativity/composition.', '2008-11-27 03:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087124, 741033, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely view of a lovely church.  The shadow is excellent.  Nice job bringing out all the texture and color here as well.</td>', 'A lovely view of a lovely church.  The shadow is excellent.  Nice job bringing out all the texture and color here as well.', '2008-11-27 09:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087126, 741404, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like your chosen DOF and the decision to present this in B&amp;W.  Though the tree is bare indicating season, it could be warm or cold - the B&amp;W leaves that to us in a way.  Lovely view - I also like that the bench seems to be enjoying it, even though there''s no one there to share it.</td>', 'I really like your chosen DOF and the decision to present this in B&W.  Though the tree is bare indicating season, it could be warm or cold - the B&W leaves that to us in a way.  Lovely view - I also like that the bench seems to be enjoying it, even though there''s no one there to share it.', '2008-11-27 09:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087127, 740987, 30982, '<td valign="top">Splendid perspective!!  Love the way this highlights the vines/tree above.</td>', 'Splendid perspective!!  Love the way this highlights the vines/tree above.', '2008-11-27 09:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087130, 741438, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely classic view.  I like how you''ve rendered the tree and the bench and yet faded/blurred the walls.  Very enjoyable view.</td>', 'A lovely classic view.  I like how you''ve rendered the tree and the bench and yet faded/blurred the walls.  Very enjoyable view.', '2008-11-27 09:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087131, 741283, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very warm and inviting setting - lovely mottled and gentle light.  I like the processing for this, although there''s a bit of what looks to be a waffle-pattern of artifacting on the bench end and the grass - not sure what does that.  I also like the statue sitting there alone as well - nice counterbalance.</td>', 'A very warm and inviting setting - lovely mottled and gentle light.  I like the processing for this, although there''s a bit of what looks to be a waffle-pattern of artifacting on the bench end and the grass - not sure what does that.  I also like the statue sitting there alone as well - nice counterbalance.', '2008-11-27 09:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087134, 741445, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way that bit of light hits the leaves behind the bench - really pretty.  The tree beyond is a bit strong but does add a sense of the overall setting (and I suspect you didn''t have a chainsaw handy.)</td>', 'I like the way that bit of light hits the leaves behind the bench - really pretty.  The tree beyond is a bit strong but does add a sense of the overall setting (and I suspect you didn''t have a chainsaw handy.)', '2008-11-27 09:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087136, 741402, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ooooh - love wide, love the B&amp;W, and like the sense of three.  Wonderful into the light approach as well.  Nice!</td>', 'Ooooh - love wide, love the B&W, and like the sense of three.  Wonderful into the light approach as well.  Nice!', '2008-11-27 09:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087137, 740977, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat how the bench picks up the blue.  Nice perspective and good entry for the challenge.</td>', 'Neat how the bench picks up the blue.  Nice perspective and good entry for the challenge.', '2008-11-27 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087139, 740839, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contre-jour.  My only nit would be losing the top of the light pole.</td>', 'Nice use of contre-jour.  My only nit would be losing the top of the light pole.', '2008-11-27 09:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087140, 741400, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely bench and a gorgeous dog - good combination!  I like the pastel feel to this - somehow it nicely balances the "solidness" of both the bench and the implied friendship of the dog.</td>', 'Lovely bench and a gorgeous dog - good combination!  I like the pastel feel to this - somehow it nicely balances the "solidness" of both the bench and the implied friendship of the dog.', '2008-11-27 09:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087141, 741369, 98594, '<td valign="top">Lighting is so dramatic and well balance.  love it.</td>', 'Lighting is so dramatic and well balance.  love it.', '2008-11-27 09:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087153, 741369, 71310, '<td valign="top">It''s all about the feeling. Sunrise is my favorite time of day, so I''m biased, yet this is a lovely composition with perfect placement of the bench and the sun.</td>', 'It''s all about the feeling. Sunrise is my favorite time of day, so I''m biased, yet this is a lovely composition with perfect placement of the bench and the sun.', '2008-11-27 09:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087176, 740473, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones you have here - almost seems as though it''s not quite fully B&amp;W.</td>', 'Really like the tones you have here - almost seems as though it''s not quite fully B&W.', '2008-11-27 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087178, 740888, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hee!  Well spotted and nice addition of the mask.  Now if you only had a kid in the mask...  And obviously that''s Clarence, the cross-eyed lion.</td>', 'Hee!  Well spotted and nice addition of the mask.  Now if you only had a kid in the mask...  And obviously that''s Clarence, the cross-eyed lion.', '2008-11-27 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087179, 741435, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful place to have a bench and the light is gorgeous in this.  I do wonder what caused you to cut off the other side of the bench, though.</td>', 'Wonderful place to have a bench and the light is gorgeous in this.  I do wonder what caused you to cut off the other side of the bench, though.', '2008-11-27 10:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087181, 741389, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect title and a rather intriguing photograph at least in part because of the mood you set with it.</td>', 'Perfect title and a rather intriguing photograph at least in part because of the mood you set with it.', '2008-11-27 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087183, 740079, 30982, '<td valign="top">I try to guess titles from time to time - missed on this one.  (Would have called it "Three".)  Really a nice choice for the challenge - the light and tones are handled well here.</td>', 'I try to guess titles from time to time - missed on this one.  (Would have called it "Three".)  Really a nice choice for the challenge - the light and tones are handled well here.', '2008-11-27 10:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087185, 741432, 30982, '<td valign="top">A rather uninviting bench in it''s present state, but rather pristine in it''s own way.  Do I see airplanes in the distance?  My nit would be having the top of the table blend into the horizon line - makes it seem just a bit unbalanced to me.</td>', 'A rather uninviting bench in it''s present state, but rather pristine in it''s own way.  Do I see airplanes in the distance?  My nit would be having the top of the table blend into the horizon line - makes it seem just a bit unbalanced to me.', '2008-11-27 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087186, 741416, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of a dramatic sky and some lovely light.</td>', 'Very nice use of a dramatic sky and some lovely light.', '2008-11-27 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087192, 741487, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, but he should keep the ring concealed until she gets there!!  Nice setting for a proposal.  Foreground light is just a tad harsh but am not entirely sure how to light it "softer" - you may want to ask in the forums after the challenge if you''re interested.</td>', 'Ah, but he should keep the ring concealed until she gets there!!  Nice setting for a proposal.  Foreground light is just a tad harsh but am not entirely sure how to light it "softer" - you may want to ask in the forums after the challenge if you''re interested.', '2008-11-27 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087205, 741493, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the soup part - I might have titled it "Waiting for the bus"...  I do like the rather odd and unexpected contrast of the pumpkin.</td>', 'Not sure about the soup part - I might have titled it "Waiting for the bus"...  I do like the rather odd and unexpected contrast of the pumpkin.', '2008-11-27 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087207, 741489, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the isolation of the bench sitters by the use of the long exposure.  The miniaturization effect is kinda nifty too.  The desat is not my favorite thing, but it is interestingly done here.</td>', 'I really like the isolation of the bench sitters by the use of the long exposure.  The miniaturization effect is kinda nifty too.  The desat is not my favorite thing, but it is interestingly done here.', '2008-11-27 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087211, 741341, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure I agree with the title (I''m in a title kind of mood this evening).  I''d have called it "Concerto for Two" as it seems as though the two benches are there for the concert offered by the waterfall.  On my laptop, the light is a bit harsh, washed out, lowish contrast.  My laptop is a bit on the brightish side (an entry of my own also appears much harsher and washed out on it).</td>', 'Not sure I agree with the title (I''m in a title kind of mood this evening).  I''d have called it "Concerto for Two" as it seems as though the two benches are there for the concert offered by the waterfall.  On my laptop, the light is a bit harsh, washed out, lowish contrast.  My laptop is a bit on the brightish side (an entry of my own also appears much harsher and washed out on it).', '2008-11-27 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087214, 741474, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection of lines and textures.  Probably too busy for some but I quite like the way they all sorta blend together.  This might be fun to try in B&amp;W, too.</td>', 'A lovely collection of lines and textures.  Probably too busy for some but I quite like the way they all sorta blend together.  This might be fun to try in B&W, too.', '2008-11-27 10:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087217, 741480, 30982, '<td valign="top">This almost has the feel of being a set in a stage play.  A bit contrived, perhaps, and for some reason I get the impression the loss was a basketball game that the home team didn''t win.</td>', 'This almost has the feel of being a set in a stage play.  A bit contrived, perhaps, and for some reason I get the impression the loss was a basketball game that the home team didn''t win.', '2008-11-27 10:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087219, 741440, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the swoop of the branch over the top of the bench, and the fact that it''s a natural suburban setting with actual houses visible!  The sheen of ice is apparent and the bright winter white of the sky seems quite appropriate.  My nit is I''m not sure why it would be slanted - it doesn''t seem to add in this instance.</td>', 'I really like the swoop of the branch over the top of the bench, and the fact that it''s a natural suburban setting with actual houses visible!  The sheen of ice is apparent and the bright winter white of the sky seems quite appropriate.  My nit is I''m not sure why it would be slanted - it doesn''t seem to add in this instance.', '2008-11-27 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087220, 741356, 30982, '<td valign="top">What is very cool about this is the wave crashing into the rocks right there appears to be a show put on specifically for the people who sit at that bench.  The wall even forms a "stage front" if you will.</td>', 'What is very cool about this is the wave crashing into the rocks right there appears to be a show put on specifically for the people who sit at that bench.  The wall even forms a "stage front" if you will.', '2008-11-27 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087232, 741277, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a different take on "bench" - the angle adds interest, in my opinion, as does the yellow.</td>', 'Definitely a different take on "bench" - the angle adds interest, in my opinion, as does the yellow.', '2008-11-27 11:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087235, 741456, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wicked lens flare!  Like it a lot!  Like the sparkly bits, too.  Nice, different approach!</td>', 'Wicked lens flare!  Like it a lot!  Like the sparkly bits, too.  Nice, different approach!', '2008-11-27 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087236, 741039, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great use of a long exposure - you''ve depicted "busy" well, and the respite that a bench offers in this instance.</td>', 'Great use of a long exposure - you''ve depicted "busy" well, and the respite that a bench offers in this instance.', '2008-11-27 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087239, 741110, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice angle to emphasize the woodwork on the benches and still give good context.  It does appear as though it may have been a bit underexposed to begin with.</td>', 'A nice angle to emphasize the woodwork on the benches and still give good context.  It does appear as though it may have been a bit underexposed to begin with.', '2008-11-27 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087242, 741314, 30982, '<td valign="top">Might be perceived as more of a couch than a bench, but it''s a pretty cool shot - love the composition with the sun mirror on the wall and the very detached expression of your model.</td>', 'Might be perceived as more of a couch than a bench, but it''s a pretty cool shot - love the composition with the sun mirror on the wall and the very detached expression of your model.', '2008-11-27 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087246, 741500, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love this is monochrome - that and your perspective combine to very nicely highlight the nifty lines formed by the supports.  Neat shot!</td>', 'Love this is monochrome - that and your perspective combine to very nicely highlight the nifty lines formed by the supports.  Neat shot!', '2008-11-27 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087248, 741423, 30982, '<td valign="top">What strkes me about this is how out of place the poor bench seems.  It seems so much drabber and plainer than the rest of the setting - the lovely building, the waterfall, the nice lights - and this poor lonely utilitarian bench, all marked up.</td>', 'What strkes me about this is how out of place the poor bench seems.  It seems so much drabber and plainer than the rest of the setting - the lovely building, the waterfall, the nice lights - and this poor lonely utilitarian bench, all marked up.', '2008-11-27 11:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087249, 741365, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really cool with the starkness, and I like the five figures in the distance - for me that adds a lot to the shot.</td>', 'Really cool with the starkness, and I like the five figures in the distance - for me that adds a lot to the shot.', '2008-11-27 11:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087252, 741336, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a peaceful setting - seems it would be a lovely place to sit and chat.</td>', 'What a peaceful setting - seems it would be a lovely place to sit and chat.', '2008-11-27 11:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087253, 741434, 30982, '<td valign="top">They seem rather utilitarian and plain, somewhat uninviting, as though the park commission didn''t put much thought into the benches.  The presentation here documents their existence, but isn''t otherwise inspiring, as though you were indeed trying to show the plain-ness here.</td>', 'They seem rather utilitarian and plain, somewhat uninviting, as though the park commission didn''t put much thought into the benches.  The presentation here documents their existence, but isn''t otherwise inspiring, as though you were indeed trying to show the plain-ness here.', '2008-11-27 11:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087255, 741452, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of bench - and I like the tree beyond (hence the angle you chose).  Kinda wish you hadn''t cut off the far end - leave that little bit of curved metal in there.  I don''t hate the desat, but almost think I''d prefer straight B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like your choice of bench - and I like the tree beyond (hence the angle you chose).  Kinda wish you hadn''t cut off the far end - leave that little bit of curved metal in there.  I don''t hate the desat, but almost think I''d prefer straight B&W.', '2008-11-27 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087263, 741490, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting how some of the trees seem almost whitewashed - the two prominent branches at the top seem to balance the bench, too.</td>', 'Interesting how some of the trees seem almost whitewashed - the two prominent branches at the top seem to balance the bench, too.', '2008-11-27 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087267, 741454, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well worn and a bit long in the tooth - I like the cinder block as the alternate leg.  I suspect it''s days as a bench are near over - it will join the stacked logs as firewood.</td>', 'Well worn and a bit long in the tooth - I like the cinder block as the alternate leg.  I suspect it''s days as a bench are near over - it will join the stacked logs as firewood.', '2008-11-27 11:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087269, 741449, 30982, '<td valign="top">The photograph gives me the impression the two girls are related somehow and at the moment are not speaking.  The "waiting" is for one or the other to make the first move.</td>', 'The photograph gives me the impression the two girls are related somehow and at the moment are not speaking.  The "waiting" is for one or the other to make the first move.', '2008-11-27 11:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087287, 741314, 36606, '<td valign="top">one of my picks for ribbon. lovely shot</td>', 'one of my picks for ribbon. lovely shot', '2008-11-27 12:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087297, 741309, 80096, '<td valign="top">Definitely a fav! 10</td>', 'Definitely a fav! 10', '2008-11-27 12:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087300, 741317, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 8</td>', 'Very nice. 8', '2008-11-27 12:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087301, 741369, 80096, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. 9</td>', 'Spectacular. 9', '2008-11-27 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087302, 741234, 80096, '<td valign="top">Great capture! 7</td>', 'Great capture! 7', '2008-11-27 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087431, 741318, 100566, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used depth of field to draw the viewer''s eye to the man.</td>', 'I like the way you used depth of field to draw the viewer''s eye to the man.', '2008-11-27 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087438, 741448, 100566, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I like the highlights on the step edges.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I like the highlights on the step edges.', '2008-11-27 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087930, 740987, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective</td>', 'I like the perspective', '2008-11-28 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087938, 740782, 48697, '<td valign="top">great tone and perspective</td>', 'great tone and perspective', '2008-11-28 00:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087960, 741234, 30982, '<td valign="top">Does look like a cozy place to nap in the sun.  Compositionally, seems to me as though a bit too much forground, or an unbalance of foreground.  Maybe slide your view just a touch to pull the occupied bench a little lower in the frame and keep the edge of the third bench.</td>', 'Does look like a cozy place to nap in the sun.  Compositionally, seems to me as though a bit too much forground, or an unbalance of foreground.  Maybe slide your view just a touch to pull the occupied bench a little lower in the frame and keep the edge of the third bench.', '2008-11-28 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087962, 741200, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of curves.  This is one instance where cutting off the bench works for the composition.</td>', 'Nice collection of curves.  This is one instance where cutting off the bench works for the composition.', '2008-11-28 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087963, 741397, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice wide view, lovely light!</td>', 'Very nice wide view, lovely light!', '2008-11-28 00:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087966, 739834, 30982, '<td valign="top">The tilt serves to make it almost abstract - I like the busy-ness the mass of leaves creates.</td>', 'The tilt serves to make it almost abstract - I like the busy-ness the mass of leaves creates.', '2008-11-28 00:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087968, 741378, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''d sit there - he''s kinda scary!</td>', 'Not sure I''d sit there - he''s kinda scary!', '2008-11-28 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087971, 741501, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition is nicely balanced to me.  My nit would be it''s hard to make out the snow on top of the bench arm versus that on the rest of the bench but it''s awfully hard to shoot white on white on white!</td>', 'Composition is nicely balanced to me.  My nit would be it''s hard to make out the snow on top of the bench arm versus that on the rest of the bench but it''s awfully hard to shoot white on white on white!', '2008-11-28 00:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087973, 740751, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful.  I like the centering of the foreground benchs and the other two in the distance.  Nice scene!</td>', 'Very peaceful.  I like the centering of the foreground benchs and the other two in the distance.  Nice scene!', '2008-11-28 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087975, 740512, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice choice of angle to create a good dynamic.</td>', 'A nice choice of angle to create a good dynamic.', '2008-11-28 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087976, 741453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean - nice detail.  Almost like pairs of eyes watching you.</td>', 'Simple and clean - nice detail.  Almost like pairs of eyes watching you.', '2008-11-28 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087977, 741398, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an unusual bench!  Nice find.  Can''t say I''m overly thrilled with the desat, but it does isolate your subject and you did a clean job with it.</td>', 'Now that''s an unusual bench!  Nice find.  Can''t say I''m overly thrilled with the desat, but it does isolate your subject and you did a clean job with it.', '2008-11-28 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087981, 741355, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the sentiment you created with your composition, though I do kinda wish you''d left in the right edge of the bench and the first part of the name.</td>', 'I like the sentiment you created with your composition, though I do kinda wish you''d left in the right edge of the bench and the first part of the name.', '2008-11-28 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087983, 741461, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the flow of lines created by both the planks and the grain of the wood.  You might even try this at a more dramatic angle, though it would create a different "feel".</td>', 'I like the flow of lines created by both the planks and the grain of the wood.  You might even try this at a more dramatic angle, though it would create a different "feel".', '2008-11-28 00:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087984, 741476, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice starkness created here and I like the long shadows on the bench.</td>', 'Nice starkness created here and I like the long shadows on the bench.', '2008-11-28 00:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087986, 741271, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is delightful!  What a great expression from our model who does indeed look more than a tad miffed.  Interesting and odd sense of proportion, as though the bench is somewhat small in nature, or the dog oddly huge.  I like the bit of color added by the flower, and the cobwebs on the wall.</td>', 'This is delightful!  What a great expression from our model who does indeed look more than a tad miffed.  Interesting and odd sense of proportion, as though the bench is somewhat small in nature, or the dog oddly huge.  I like the bit of color added by the flower, and the cobwebs on the wall.', '2008-11-28 00:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087987, 740557, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of wide angle and long exposure.  Pleasing tableau presented here.</td>', 'Nice use of wide angle and long exposure.  Pleasing tableau presented here.', '2008-11-28 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087988, 741073, 30982, '<td valign="top">Presents a sense of isolation, but not an unwanted isolation - more of a pleasant quiet moment of peace.</td>', 'Presents a sense of isolation, but not an unwanted isolation - more of a pleasant quiet moment of peace.', '2008-11-28 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087990, 741318, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the composition here - I think I''ve seen this row of benches before?  Very pleasant and well-presented view.</td>', 'Love the composition here - I think I''ve seen this row of benches before?  Very pleasant and well-presented view.', '2008-11-28 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5087991, 741159, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot - great lines and angles and the touch of color from the leaves is excellent.</td>', 'My kind of shot - great lines and angles and the touch of color from the leaves is excellent.', '2008-11-28 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088000, 741322, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pleasant view, well composed.</td>', 'A pleasant view, well composed.', '2008-11-28 00:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088002, 741369, 30982, '<td valign="top">Glorious in both light and composition - how very nice to have such a blissful place to park a bench!</td>', 'Glorious in both light and composition - how very nice to have such a blissful place to park a bench!', '2008-11-28 00:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088004, 741282, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice moment - perhaps a bit busy for this crowd but I think it works pretty well.</td>', 'A nice moment - perhaps a bit busy for this crowd but I think it works pretty well.', '2008-11-28 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088009, 740483, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good, solid basic bench in a nice setting.  Perhaps a bit plain as a picture but meets the challenge and has good light, good focus.</td>', 'A good, solid basic bench in a nice setting.  Perhaps a bit plain as a picture but meets the challenge and has good light, good focus.', '2008-11-28 00:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088011, 741007, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgous view, lovely time of day to take a picture.  I like the almost monochromatic sense to it with the almost metalic tan/beige of the bench and buildings with the gray blue of the sky and water.</td>', 'Gorgous view, lovely time of day to take a picture.  I like the almost monochromatic sense to it with the almost metalic tan/beige of the bench and buildings with the gray blue of the sky and water.', '2008-11-28 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088012, 741361, 30982, '<td valign="top">A tad brightish in parts perhaps, but pretty well balanced for composition and an interesting bench.</td>', 'A tad brightish in parts perhaps, but pretty well balanced for composition and an interesting bench.', '2008-11-28 00:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088014, 741332, 30982, '<td valign="top">I count it as a "bench" - nature gives us all sorts of cool places to sit and think.  The composition seems just a tad awkward to me but I''m not sure what I''d do differently either.  Nice calm view.</td>', 'I count it as a "bench" - nature gives us all sorts of cool places to sit and think.  The composition seems just a tad awkward to me but I''m not sure what I''d do differently either.  Nice calm view.', '2008-11-28 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088016, 741161, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much like the man/dog story here - they seem quite devoted to each other.  The busy-ness of the background actually serves to isolate them nicely here.</td>', 'Very much like the man/dog story here - they seem quite devoted to each other.  The busy-ness of the background actually serves to isolate them nicely here.', '2008-11-28 01:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088020, 741376, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I do not get "grief" from the picture - more of a sense of enduring love and peace.</td>', 'Interesting - I do not get "grief" from the picture - more of a sense of enduring love and peace.', '2008-11-28 01:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088021, 741337, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the bench seems almost spotlighted here.  I do like that it is looking "out" of the picture, but it''s somewhat unconventional (based on conventional "rules") and it may bother some folks.  I like the "y" formed in the path, too.</td>', 'Interesting how the bench seems almost spotlighted here.  I do like that it is looking "out" of the picture, but it''s somewhat unconventional (based on conventional "rules") and it may bother some folks.  I like the "y" formed in the path, too.', '2008-11-28 01:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088024, 741413, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good color/patterns and seems to be nicely balanced to me.</td>', 'Good color/patterns and seems to be nicely balanced to me.', '2008-11-28 01:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088025, 740841, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the wide, love the monochrome, and really like the dog and person and the way you''ve framed/included them.  I even like the tilt - works here for some reason.  The bench, in addition to being a primary element, also works to tie it all together.  Nice!</td>', 'Love the wide, love the monochrome, and really like the dog and person and the way you''ve framed/included them.  I even like the tilt - works here for some reason.  The bench, in addition to being a primary element, also works to tie it all together.  Nice!', '2008-11-28 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088041, 741436, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2008-11-28 01:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088042, 741110, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great tones and leading lines.</td>', 'Great tones and leading lines.', '2008-11-28 01:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088043, 740557, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great wide angle and POV.</td>', 'Great wide angle and POV.', '2008-11-28 01:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088107, 741218, 101012, '<td valign="top">gr8!!</td>', 'gr8!!', '2008-11-28 04:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088167, 741417, 101019, '<td valign="top">i like the color, i fill like in a fable.</td>', 'i like the color, i fill like in a fable.', '2008-11-28 07:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088343, 741378, 91496, '<td valign="top">Bench is kind of cool.  Nice textuers. Not sure I like the curve effect on the staute and teh blwn out sky.</td>', 'Bench is kind of cool.  Nice textuers. Not sure I like the curve effect on the staute and teh blwn out sky.', '2008-11-28 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088345, 741436, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and compostition.  Subject ends up being a little static.</td>', 'Nice lighting and compostition.  Subject ends up being a little static.', '2008-11-28 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088348, 741309, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Well composed.  Shadows setrat a little bit.</td>', 'Cute.  Well composed.  Shadows setrat a little bit.', '2008-11-28 10:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088350, 740557, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Sky really adds to the shot.  I think the negative space on the lower left detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Sky really adds to the shot.  I think the negative space on the lower left detracts from the shot.', '2008-11-28 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088352, 740452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some may feel your bench isn''t apparent enough here - but I think that''s probably the point of the picture.  With everyone going to and fro, no one has time for the bench, yet it sits there and waits just the same.  The fall color and light is very nice here - really a nice shot of a fall day.</td>', 'Some may feel your bench isn''t apparent enough here - but I think that''s probably the point of the picture.  With everyone going to and fro, no one has time for the bench, yet it sits there and waits just the same.  The fall color and light is very nice here - really a nice shot of a fall day.', '2008-11-28 10:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088353, 740512, 91496, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Great silhouette.  The blobly highlight of the sun detracts.  I wonder what it would look like with with the sun cloned out.</td>', 'Really nice.  Great silhouette.  The blobly highlight of the sun detracts.  I wonder what it would look like with with the sun cloned out.', '2008-11-28 10:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088354, 741285, 30982, '<td valign="top">An engaging candid.  I like the oddness of the butterfly mug and the Tazmanian devil t-shirt combination.</td>', 'An engaging candid.  I like the oddness of the butterfly mug and the Tazmanian devil t-shirt combination.', '2008-11-28 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088356, 741154, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, the annoyance of graffiti.  There are times when it''s a wonderful artform but other times when it is indeed an annoyance.  I very much like the view here - the soft pastels are lovely.</td>', 'Ah, the annoyance of graffiti.  There are times when it''s a wonderful artform but other times when it is indeed an annoyance.  I very much like the view here - the soft pastels are lovely.', '2008-11-28 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088357, 741317, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting bench!  Lovely setting for one, though perhaps not the best of days to sit and watch the ocean from there - looks to have a bit of a chill in the wind.</td>', 'A very interesting bench!  Lovely setting for one, though perhaps not the best of days to sit and watch the ocean from there - looks to have a bit of a chill in the wind.', '2008-11-28 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088358, 741498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of textures here.</td>', 'Nice collection of textures here.', '2008-11-28 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088359, 741442, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pleasing composition, particularly with the inclusion of the overhead branches.</td>', 'A pleasing composition, particularly with the inclusion of the overhead branches.', '2008-11-28 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088360, 741483, 30982, '<td valign="top">One can almost see the child leaving the edge of the frame, off to play but will be back to collect the doll before long.</td>', 'One can almost see the child leaving the edge of the frame, off to play but will be back to collect the doll before long.', '2008-11-28 11:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088361, 741436, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  A nice example of how a vignette can be used to enclose or complete a picture.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  A nice example of how a vignette can be used to enclose or complete a picture.', '2008-11-28 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088362, 741309, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors. i would like to see a little more of the bench as the challenge topic is benches, not darling, furry squirrels eating nuts, but I didn''t deduct for that. ;) Your detail in the bench back and the squirrel is very good.</td>', 'Nice rich colors. i would like to see a little more of the bench as the challenge topic is benches, not darling, furry squirrels eating nuts, but I didn''t deduct for that. ;) Your detail in the bench back and the squirrel is very good.', '2008-11-28 11:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088364, 741426, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the colors here. The crop works well to draw the eye across the photograph. To me, the texture treatment does not add interest. It isn''t needed as the shot would do well on it''s one merits. I....think....I like the frame.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the colors here. The crop works well to draw the eye across the photograph. To me, the texture treatment does not add interest. It isn''t needed as the shot would do well on it''s one merits. I....think....I like the frame.', '2008-11-28 11:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088367, 741285, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the shot in b&amp;w. I would have preferred a wider shot with more emphasis on the bench(es) than the man. Unfortunate that you can see so much of the watch. ;)  All in all, a nice photograph.</td>', 'I like the shot in b&w. I would have preferred a wider shot with more emphasis on the bench(es) than the man. Unfortunate that you can see so much of the watch. ;)  All in all, a nice photograph.', '2008-11-28 11:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088372, 741014, 63244, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but this is a very peaceful photograph.  I love the fact that it''s in color as most try to do cemetary shots in black and white. The bright leaves draw you the the bench which meets the challenge and the perspective then leads the eye through the rest of the shot.  My fave thus far. I like the border, too.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but this is a very peaceful photograph.  I love the fact that it''s in color as most try to do cemetary shots in black and white. The bright leaves draw you the the bench which meets the challenge and the perspective then leads the eye through the rest of the shot.  My fave thus far. I like the border, too.', '2008-11-28 11:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088376, 741426, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the bold angle to this.  There''s a bit of color noise on the back of the bench and the end that kinda lets this down a bit technically.</td>', 'I really like the bold angle to this.  There''s a bit of color noise on the back of the bench and the end that kinda lets this down a bit technically.', '2008-11-28 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088377, 740639, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe not technically perfect but an awesome catch!  I love the three, and those three echoed by the divisions in the object on the wall above them.</td>', 'Maybe not technically perfect but an awesome catch!  I love the three, and those three echoed by the divisions in the object on the wall above them.', '2008-11-28 11:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088379, 741478, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice place for benches, it looks like.  Perhaps a bit plain, but the composition is nicely balanced and the light is nice, too.</td>', 'A nice place for benches, it looks like.  Perhaps a bit plain, but the composition is nicely balanced and the light is nice, too.', '2008-11-28 11:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088381, 741334, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely my kind of shot!  Made me smile!  I love how she''s sitting so very closely to the side, all very proper as she reads, and the pigeon, rather uninterested in her presence, enjoying his half of the bench as well.</td>', 'Definitely my kind of shot!  Made me smile!  I love how she''s sitting so very closely to the side, all very proper as she reads, and the pigeon, rather uninterested in her presence, enjoying his half of the bench as well.', '2008-11-28 11:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088382, 741336, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like this. Lots going on. Immediately, my eyes are drawn to the big green plant on the left and then to the chairs. The rain helped make your colors a bit more vivid. If it were me, I would have cropped a bit off the left and the bottom, only to bring the chairs more into the main focus. You would maintain a bit of the yellow coloring of the far left plant, yet make the chairs and the red a bit more "immediate".   My ever so HUMBLE opinion.  I do like this photo and your path leads you to the chairs.</td>', 'I like this. Lots going on. Immediately, my eyes are drawn to the big green plant on the left and then to the chairs. The rain helped make your colors a bit more vivid. If it were me, I would have cropped a bit off the left and the bottom, only to bring the chairs more into the main focus. You would maintain a bit of the yellow coloring of the far left plant, yet make the chairs and the red a bit more "immediate".   My ever so HUMBLE opinion.  I do like this photo and your path leads you to the chairs.', '2008-11-28 11:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088383, 741433, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice capture of a scenic view.</td>', 'A nice capture of a scenic view.', '2008-11-28 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088384, 741448, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good choice to go with B&amp;W - nice lines/curves to this.</td>', 'Good choice to go with B&W - nice lines/curves to this.', '2008-11-28 11:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088386, 741419, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - he appears to be sleeping which makes you wonder about leaving the guitar out in th eopen.  The only disconcerting thing to me is it almost appears there''s a cloth or something behind the bench, screening/blurring the background.  Can''t quite seem to reconcile that.</td>', 'I like the composition - he appears to be sleeping which makes you wonder about leaving the guitar out in th eopen.  The only disconcerting thing to me is it almost appears there''s a cloth or something behind the bench, screening/blurring the background.  Can''t quite seem to reconcile that.', '2008-11-28 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088388, 740452, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors and the slight vingetting on this shot!  I might have tried a little different perspective as you don''t notice the bench much and that was the challenge topic. I also would have cropped out the peron on the far left to create a more natural framing of the shot.  Our leaves arent'' that pretty right now.</td>', 'I like the bright colors and the slight vingetting on this shot!  I might have tried a little different perspective as you don''t notice the bench much and that was the challenge topic. I also would have cropped out the peron on the far left to create a more natural framing of the shot.  Our leaves arent'' that pretty right now.', '2008-11-28 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088391, 741310, 63244, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting take. I like it, but it''s hard for me to look at very long. :)</td>', 'It''s an interesting take. I like it, but it''s hard for me to look at very long. :)', '2008-11-28 11:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088393, 741228, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely bench!  It almost appears to be floating in the light.</td>', 'What a lovely bench!  It almost appears to be floating in the light.', '2008-11-28 11:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088395, 741248, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely choice of perspective and composition.</td>', 'Lovely choice of perspective and composition.', '2008-11-28 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088396, 741447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks to be street-light lit - I like it.</td>', 'Looks to be street-light lit - I like it.', '2008-11-28 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088397, 740888, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the bench. So clean and simple.</td>', 'Love the bench. So clean and simple.', '2008-11-28 11:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088399, 740873, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the semi-panoramic approach to show the vastness.  I kinda wish you might have moved a couple steps to the left to have the bench more open to the water (ie not have it''s view blocked by the vegetation.)</td>', 'I like the semi-panoramic approach to show the vastness.  I kinda wish you might have moved a couple steps to the left to have the bench more open to the water (ie not have it''s view blocked by the vegetation.)', '2008-11-28 11:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088412, 741318, 34192, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t bring forth Manet for me (title reference), but I find the image extremely compelling. Well visioned - excellently composed, toned, and thought out. Reminds me of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6999" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">e301</a> in that sense.  The depth of field is wonderful and telling - seeing the blurry past, following through the frame to the present and the close at hand future.  Beautifully conceived, an entire life story of sorts.  you sold me. 10</td>', 'Doesn''t bring forth Manet for me (title reference), but I find the image extremely compelling. Well visioned - excellently composed, toned, and thought out. Reminds me of e301 in that sense.  The depth of field is wonderful and telling - seeing the blurry past, following through the frame to the present and the close at hand future.  Beautifully conceived, an entire life story of sorts.  you sold me. 10', '2008-11-28 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088414, 741109, 30982, '<td valign="top">While the focus may not be the bench (at least perhaps not for the voters in this particular challenge) I do like how it shows the smallness of the person in contrast to the setting.  There''s a big wide world out there, but she sits on her bench, in her space.</td>', 'While the focus may not be the bench (at least perhaps not for the voters in this particular challenge) I do like how it shows the smallness of the person in contrast to the setting.  There''s a big wide world out there, but she sits on her bench, in her space.', '2008-11-28 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088419, 741429, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the riot of texture here - almost oversharpened maybe, but I like the effect.  The fact you can''t quite tell if she''s looking at you or not quite is disconcerting, but in an interesting not a bad way.  And the bench seems sort of suspended in space - also rather intriguing.</td>', 'I really like the riot of texture here - almost oversharpened maybe, but I like the effect.  The fact you can''t quite tell if she''s looking at you or not quite is disconcerting, but in an interesting not a bad way.  And the bench seems sort of suspended in space - also rather intriguing.', '2008-11-28 11:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088424, 741444, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the phantom guy.  Also really quite like the bench and how you''ve brought out the slats and the underside of the canopy.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the phantom guy.  Also really quite like the bench and how you''ve brought out the slats and the underside of the canopy.  Nice shot.', '2008-11-28 11:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088425, 741154, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors.  The lighting seems a bit off - HDR type processing?  Composition a little static - nothing pulls me into moving about the image. 6</td>', 'Very pretty colors.  The lighting seems a bit off - HDR type processing?  Composition a little static - nothing pulls me into moving about the image. 6', '2008-11-28 11:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088430, 740782, 30982, '<td valign="top">Don''t much care for the odd style of lettering in the title, but that''s showing my age.  :-) I REALLY like the single leaf and the angle you chose to present the bench to us.  Also like the sparklies in the background.</td>', 'Don''t much care for the odd style of lettering in the title, but that''s showing my age.  :-) I REALLY like the single leaf and the angle you chose to present the bench to us.  Also like the sparklies in the background.', '2008-11-28 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088434, 741310, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  I like your processing here alot as well.  The softness suits as does that wee hint of color left.</td>', 'Very sweet.  I like your processing here alot as well.  The softness suits as does that wee hint of color left.', '2008-11-28 11:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088437, 741083, 34192, '<td valign="top">love the under exposure.  Composition good. tomes well used. 7</td>', 'love the under exposure.  Composition good. tomes well used. 7', '2008-11-28 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088442, 741485, 30982, '<td valign="top">A quiet poignancy.  Is there something she''s watching, or is she just thinking of things that might have been?</td>', 'A quiet poignancy.  Is there something she''s watching, or is she just thinking of things that might have been?', '2008-11-28 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088443, 741350, 77192, '<td valign="top">clever. love the lines in this shot.</td>', 'clever. love the lines in this shot.', '2008-11-28 11:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088446, 741375, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good use of the bench and setting to provide a natural portrait!</td>', 'Very good use of the bench and setting to provide a natural portrait!', '2008-11-28 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088449, 741417, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost a Where''s Waldo With Bench!  Love the riot of color, the cacophony of texture!</td>', 'Almost a Where''s Waldo With Bench!  Love the riot of color, the cacophony of texture!', '2008-11-28 11:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088450, 741436, 77192, '<td valign="top">clean and simple. Love it!</td>', 'clean and simple. Love it!', '2008-11-28 11:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088454, 741499, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy but that''s to be expected with the low light.  My nit would be the somewhat static composition with the gear cut out at the bottom.  I do like the "indoor" benches just barely visible through the window behind - makes you wonder why this person is waiting outside.</td>', 'A bit grainy but that''s to be expected with the low light.  My nit would be the somewhat static composition with the gear cut out at the bottom.  I do like the "indoor" benches just barely visible through the window behind - makes you wonder why this person is waiting outside.', '2008-11-28 11:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088455, 741057, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscaping and a well balanced composition with the lines formed by the streetlights and red paths.  My nit would be the flag "ending" in the lightpole.</td>', 'Lovely landscaping and a well balanced composition with the lines formed by the streetlights and red paths.  My nit would be the flag "ending" in the lightpole.', '2008-11-28 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088456, 739847, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting find indeed!  I like the soft pastels.</td>', 'An interesting find indeed!  I like the soft pastels.', '2008-11-28 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088460, 741376, 34192, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t speak to me of grief but is a beautiful image non the less.  Well post processed. bump.</td>', 'this doesn''t speak to me of grief but is a beautiful image non the less.  Well post processed. bump.', '2008-11-28 11:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088461, 741259, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing - creates almost a void in the floor with the darker tiles giving a surreal impression, which I suspect is how most waiting rooms feel sometimes.</td>', 'Interesting processing - creates almost a void in the floor with the darker tiles giving a surreal impression, which I suspect is how most waiting rooms feel sometimes.', '2008-11-28 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088464, 741430, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an eclectic storefront.  One would suspect the store to be equally odd and random.</td>', 'What an eclectic storefront.  One would suspect the store to be equally odd and random.', '2008-11-28 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088466, 741083, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice balance to this.</td>', 'Nice balance to this.', '2008-11-28 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088469, 741369, 34192, '<td valign="top">You know, I would probably put a bench there too.  Excellent timing for best light, composed well. bumped to 8 after viewing all others.</td>', 'You know, I would probably put a bench there too.  Excellent timing for best light, composed well. bumped to 8 after viewing all others.', '2008-11-28 11:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088479, 741425, 30982, '<td valign="top">It has seen better days - one wonders if it has been intentionally disfigured.  Meets the challenge (it''s definitely a bench!) with good focus but is a rather plain view.</td>', 'It has seen better days - one wonders if it has been intentionally disfigured.  Meets the challenge (it''s definitely a bench!) with good focus but is a rather plain view.', '2008-11-28 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088481, 741050, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely place to put a bench - nice place to watch the sun set.</td>', 'Lovely place to put a bench - nice place to watch the sun set.', '2008-11-28 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088483, 740784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective to catch not only the curve of the bench but to echo it in the reflected shorline beyond.</td>', 'Nice perspective to catch not only the curve of the bench but to echo it in the reflected shorline beyond.', '2008-11-28 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088484, 741089, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like the poor thing is stuck in a rather uninviting location.</td>', 'Looks like the poor thing is stuck in a rather uninviting location.', '2008-11-28 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088486, 741088, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and textures.  And I like the play on words with your title.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and textures.  And I like the play on words with your title.', '2008-11-28 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088488, 741011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ray''s lesser known cousin, BillyBob....  I like how the focus here is clearly on the graffiti.  Neat shot.</td>', 'Ray''s lesser known cousin, BillyBob....  I like how the focus here is clearly on the graffiti.  Neat shot.', '2008-11-28 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088490, 741230, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the face crawling out of the bench!  Very cool find.  Not sure of the blur beyond - seems to be added in post and kinda looks that way.</td>', 'I like the face crawling out of the bench!  Very cool find.  Not sure of the blur beyond - seems to be added in post and kinda looks that way.', '2008-11-28 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088492, 741006, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the highkeyishness - and the fact there''s one bird about to land on the banch, or so it seems.  I especially like the trash can for some reason - completes this nicely.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the highkeyishness - and the fact there''s one bird about to land on the banch, or so it seems.  I especially like the trash can for some reason - completes this nicely.', '2008-11-28 12:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088494, 741412, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with the reds!</td>', 'Very pretty with the reds!', '2008-11-28 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088496, 741431, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great pose from your gull!  B&amp;W works nicely for this.</td>', 'What a great pose from your gull!  B&W works nicely for this.', '2008-11-28 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088500, 741309, 30982, '<td valign="top">How very adorable!  He''s found the motherload and will do his darndest to get them all to safety!</td>', 'How very adorable!  He''s found the motherload and will do his darndest to get them all to safety!', '2008-11-28 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088503, 741218, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice light/processing with the golden glow.  Like the composition - the "thinker" and the tree.</td>', 'Nice light/processing with the golden glow.  Like the composition - the "thinker" and the tree.', '2008-11-28 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088505, 741014, 30982, '<td valign="top">An inetresting graveyard with the variety of markers.  The plot here appears to be one still awaiting tenants.  I like the touch of color from the left behind the bench.</td>', 'An inetresting graveyard with the variety of markers.  The plot here appears to be one still awaiting tenants.  I like the touch of color from the left behind the bench.', '2008-11-28 12:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088507, 741290, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Definitely different!  Nice find.</td>', 'Heh!  Definitely different!  Nice find.', '2008-11-28 12:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088510, 741307, 30982, '<td valign="top">A rather fancy bench - makes me think this could be a resort.</td>', 'A rather fancy bench - makes me think this could be a resort.', '2008-11-28 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088514, 741350, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great setting, enthusiastic performance from your model, nice artistic processing to complete the presentation.</td>', 'Great setting, enthusiastic performance from your model, nice artistic processing to complete the presentation.', '2008-11-28 12:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088517, 740243, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure whether it''s the appearance of corrugated aluminum, but it makes me think of a nice trailer park in Florida somewhere.</td>', 'I''m not sure whether it''s the appearance of corrugated aluminum, but it makes me think of a nice trailer park in Florida somewhere.', '2008-11-28 12:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088518, 741459, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective!  One would like somethng a bit more intriguing beyond, maybe but it is a nicely different take on the metal bench.</td>', 'An interesting perspective!  One would like somethng a bit more intriguing beyond, maybe but it is a nicely different take on the metal bench.', '2008-11-28 12:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088520, 741491, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, lovely composition, and I like the processing.</td>', 'Beautiful light, lovely composition, and I like the processing.', '2008-11-28 12:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088524, 741266, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very lovely view - nice place to have a bench.</td>', 'A very lovely view - nice place to have a bench.', '2008-11-28 12:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088526, 741323, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a stately bench and a stately row of trees to match.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'What a stately bench and a stately row of trees to match.  Lovely shot.', '2008-11-28 12:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088535, 740615, 30982, '<td valign="top">Though I don''t think the number is right for it, it gives me the feel he''s a kicker and he just missed a crucial field goal.  I do rather like the desat on this.</td>', 'Though I don''t think the number is right for it, it gives me the feel he''s a kicker and he just missed a crucial field goal.  I do rather like the desat on this.', '2008-11-28 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088585, 740873, 95579, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, would be nicer if there wasnt a bush behind the bench so you couls see all the way through the slats. still a good one though!</td>', 'Lovely shot, would be nicer if there wasnt a bush behind the bench so you couls see all the way through the slats. still a good one though!', '2008-11-28 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088588, 741259, 95579, '<td valign="top">I really dont like the effect, sorry</td>', 'I really dont like the effect, sorry', '2008-11-28 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088590, 740841, 95579, '<td valign="top">Great contrast</td>', 'Great contrast', '2008-11-28 13:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088591, 740784, 95579, '<td valign="top">Love the lines of the bench leading into the edge of the pond</td>', 'Love the lines of the bench leading into the edge of the pond', '2008-11-28 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088595, 741417, 95579, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours and how hard you have to look to see the benck.</td>', 'I really love the colours and how hard you have to look to see the benck.', '2008-11-28 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088603, 740782, 95579, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2008-11-28 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088604, 741248, 95579, '<td valign="top">I really like the greyness of everything and the angle of the bench</td>', 'I really like the greyness of everything and the angle of the bench', '2008-11-28 13:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088606, 741154, 95579, '<td valign="top">Makes me wish I was there. Superb use of colour</td>', 'Makes me wish I was there. Superb use of colour', '2008-11-28 13:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088608, 741369, 95579, '<td valign="top">A very bright view! Is there a tiny little boat by the suns reflection?<br/>Sky is very moody looking, really like it</td>', 'A very bright view! Is there a tiny little boat by the suns reflection?Sky is very moody looking, really like it', '2008-11-28 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088612, 741501, 95579, '<td valign="top">Like the dof</td>', 'Like the dof', '2008-11-28 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088613, 740639, 95579, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of life for a bench</td>', 'Lovely capture of life for a bench', '2008-11-28 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088614, 741011, 95579, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The lines, the contrast, the writing..</td>', 'I really like this shot. The lines, the contrast, the writing..', '2008-11-28 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088615, 741218, 95579, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background are a gorgeous colour and the dark foreground work really well.</td>', 'The trees in the background are a gorgeous colour and the dark foreground work really well.', '2008-11-28 13:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088616, 741323, 95579, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! Love the definition of the trees against the snow</td>', 'Fantastic shot! Love the definition of the trees against the snow', '2008-11-28 13:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088617, 741490, 95579, '<td valign="top">Really like the lighting</td>', 'Really like the lighting', '2008-11-28 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088647, 741489, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great image - I really like the feeling of serenity around the benches as though time is frozen.</td>', 'Great image - I really like the feeling of serenity around the benches as though time is frozen.', '2008-11-28 14:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088649, 741248, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good perspective which makes the shot.</td>', 'Good perspective which makes the shot.', '2008-11-28 14:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088651, 741323, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot although I wish it were a little sharper and that I could see right to the top of the trees.</td>', 'Lovely shot although I wish it were a little sharper and that I could see right to the top of the trees.', '2008-11-28 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088652, 741369, 44611, '<td valign="top">Ocean view seating!  You caught this with the light just right.</td>', 'Ocean view seating!  You caught this with the light just right.', '2008-11-28 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088653, 741317, 44611, '<td valign="top">Looks like a windy spot!  Good perspective and nice light.</td>', 'Looks like a windy spot!  Good perspective and nice light.', '2008-11-28 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088656, 741350, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well thought out .. makes a rather ordinary subject much more interesting.</td>', 'Well thought out .. makes a rather ordinary subject much more interesting.', '2008-11-28 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088658, 741426, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the bench, but this is a bit over processed and noisy for me.  Also not too keen on the very heavy border.</td>', 'Great shot of the bench, but this is a bit over processed and noisy for me.  Also not too keen on the very heavy border.', '2008-11-28 14:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088660, 741461, 44611, '<td valign="top">Gives a lovely rustic feel and I love the subtle greens in the wood tones.</td>', 'Gives a lovely rustic feel and I love the subtle greens in the wood tones.', '2008-11-28 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088661, 741154, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft feeling to this.</td>', 'Lovely soft feeling to this.', '2008-11-28 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5088663, 741501, 44611, '<td valign="top">Different approach and I like it - good depth of field.</td>', 'Different approach and I like it - good depth of field.', '2008-11-28 14:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088665, 741159, 44611, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation makes this.</td>', 'The selective desaturation makes this.', '2008-11-28 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088667, 741474, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Persian kitty ... reminds me of my first cat.   Good subject for the bench.</td>', 'Beautiful Persian kitty ... reminds me of my first cat.   Good subject for the bench.', '2008-11-28 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088669, 740987, 44611, '<td valign="top">Intriguing and interesting angle of view.   Like the light and colours too.</td>', 'Intriguing and interesting angle of view.   Like the light and colours too.', '2008-11-28 14:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088670, 741083, 44611, '<td valign="top">I keep thinking that there must have been a sign saying ''no photography'' somewhere!  Great shot.</td>', 'I keep thinking that there must have been a sign saying ''no photography'' somewhere!  Great shot.', '2008-11-28 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088671, 741435, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft light, good perspective.</td>', 'Lovely soft light, good perspective.', '2008-11-28 14:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088672, 741416, 44611, '<td valign="top">I like the drama in this shot .. not easy to get drama into a bench!</td>', 'I like the drama in this shot .. not easy to get drama into a bench!', '2008-11-28 14:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088675, 741050, 44611, '<td valign="top">This has grown on me with several viewings.  Good composition and the right time of day for the shot.</td>', 'This has grown on me with several viewings.  Good composition and the right time of day for the shot.', '2008-11-28 14:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088718, 741285, 47091, '<td valign="top">I like it great shot</td>', 'I like it great shot', '2008-11-28 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088723, 741459, 47091, '<td valign="top">That is different looking.</td>', 'That is different looking.', '2008-11-28 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088731, 741489, 47091, '<td valign="top">That looks more like a table and seats. I like the photoI just don''t think it is a bench.</td>', 'That looks more like a table and seats. I like the photoI just don''t think it is a bench.', '2008-11-28 16:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088745, 740839, 100975, '<td valign="top">I would have like this more if you would have positioned yourself so that the sun wasn''y near the center of your photo.  Still a great idea and I love the composition.</td>', 'I would have like this more if you would have positioned yourself so that the sun wasn''y near the center of your photo.  Still a great idea and I love the composition.', '2008-11-28 16:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088746, 741438, 100975, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Excellent composition.  I am adding this one to my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Excellent composition.  I am adding this one to my favorites.', '2008-11-28 16:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088747, 740841, 100975, '<td valign="top">Love the sky.  Great positioning of the camera.</td>', 'Love the sky.  Great positioning of the camera.', '2008-11-28 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
