(5088776, 740557, 100975, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The white stuff (trash, rock, whatever) on the left and the one bigger spot in the middle pull your eye away from how great this photo really is.</td>', 'Great shot.  The white stuff (trash, rock, whatever) on the left and the one bigger spot in the middle pull your eye away from how great this photo really is.', '2008-11-28 16:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
