(5088781, 741376, 100975, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!!', '2008-11-28 16:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088782, 740888, 47091, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but the lion in the photo looks cross eyed. that is distracting to me.</td>', 'I like the shot but the lion in the photo looks cross eyed. that is distracting to me.', '2008-11-28 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088783, 740452, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, there it is!<br/> <br/>Not exactly the focal point here, but I suppose it is conspicuously un-sat-on.</td>', 'Oh yes, there it is! Not exactly the focal point here, but I suppose it is conspicuously un-sat-on.', '2008-11-28 16:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088786, 741334, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very sweet shot. Like the sense of lives passing at different paces, but meeting in the middle for this one moment. Crop is too tight for me though - was this necessary to remove extraneous interference?</td>', 'Very sweet shot. Like the sense of lives passing at different paces, but meeting in the middle for this one moment. Crop is too tight for me though - was this necessary to remove extraneous interference?', '2008-11-28 16:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088787, 741423, 47091, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2008-11-28 16:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088788, 741365, 47091, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2008-11-28 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088791, 741369, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely moment - and a great sky. The boat does not look like one at this size though - more like a spec of dust. Great shadow of the bench.</td>', 'Lovely moment - and a great sky. The boat does not look like one at this size though - more like a spec of dust. Great shadow of the bench.', '2008-11-28 16:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088798, 741448, 8860, '<td valign="top">The subject is strong here, but I can''t help feel that this could have been better composed. Getting a little lower and shooting an arc from closer on the left round to the distant right perhaps may have been stronger.</td>', 'The subject is strong here, but I can''t help feel that this could have been better composed. Getting a little lower and shooting an arc from closer on the left round to the distant right perhaps may have been stronger.', '2008-11-28 16:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088806, 741336, 47091, '<td valign="top">Chairs</td>', 'Chairs', '2008-11-28 17:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088811, 741334, 47091, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the woman in home alone.</td>', 'Reminds me of the woman in home alone.', '2008-11-28 17:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088850, 741355, 47091, '<td valign="top">Great shot I love it</td>', 'Great shot I love it', '2008-11-28 17:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088856, 741337, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the composition which leads me through the photo. B&amp;W was a good choice.</td>', 'Love the composition which leads me through the photo. B&W was a good choice.', '2008-11-28 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088859, 741447, 18197, '<td valign="top">Initially the blues feel wrong, but maybe they''re reflections from sign lighting. Nice bench example.</td>', 'Initially the blues feel wrong, but maybe they''re reflections from sign lighting. Nice bench example.', '2008-11-28 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088862, 741454, 18197, '<td valign="top">There won''t be any copycat benches like this. I like your choice of subject and the ambiance you''ve created here.</td>', 'There won''t be any copycat benches like this. I like your choice of subject and the ambiance you''ve created here.', '2008-11-28 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088865, 741491, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. Composition feels a little off balance ... maybe a slight rotation anti-clockwise would help.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. Composition feels a little off balance ... maybe a slight rotation anti-clockwise would help.', '2008-11-28 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088868, 741356, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve included people inthe shot. Lighting feels a bit harsh ... but was probably a bright sunny day.</td>', 'I like that you''ve included people inthe shot. Lighting feels a bit harsh ... but was probably a bright sunny day.', '2008-11-28 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088869, 741442, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of serenity this conveys. Nicely framed by the trees. Good job.</td>', 'I like the feeling of serenity this conveys. Nicely framed by the trees. Good job.', '2008-11-28 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088871, 741322, 18197, '<td valign="top">This point of view has been done quite a bit but you pulled it off very well. Very nice color and clarity.</td>', 'This point of view has been done quite a bit but you pulled it off very well. Very nice color and clarity.', '2008-11-28 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088874, 741389, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels lonely.</td>', 'Feels lonely.', '2008-11-28 18:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088881, 741461, 33552, '<td valign="top">...but not so simple processsing! I''m guessing HDR. There are some nice bits. I like the texture and tonality around the fence line, but the overall scene is just too busy mor my tastes.</td>', '...but not so simple processsing! I''m guessing HDR. There are some nice bits. I like the texture and tonality around the fence line, but the overall scene is just too busy mor my tastes.', '2008-11-28 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088883, 741453, 33552, '<td valign="top">There''s a simple elegance in this. It almost appears 2D, but the curled metal part at the top brings in a bit of depth.</td>', 'There''s a simple elegance in this. It almost appears 2D, but the curled metal part at the top brings in a bit of depth.', '2008-11-28 18:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088889, 741489, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice! The tilted perspective adds drama to an already frantic scene. I''m not sure about leaving the color around the top, it almost seems like a distraction. Beautiful and well done, but still distracting. I would have just relied on the strong lines and motion blur in this photo to draw attention to the subject. PC lens or blured in post? Nice effect either way.</td>', 'Nice! The tilted perspective adds drama to an already frantic scene. I''m not sure about leaving the color around the top, it almost seems like a distraction. Beautiful and well done, but still distracting. I would have just relied on the strong lines and motion blur in this photo to draw attention to the subject. PC lens or blured in post? Nice effect either way.', '2008-11-28 18:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088891, 741500, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great concept! It just needs to be straightened up a bit. Also, a touch of fill flash with an overall contrast boost in post might work well here. The BG and the backstop itself kind of run togather as is.</td>', 'Great concept! It just needs to be straightened up a bit. Also, a touch of fill flash with an overall contrast boost in post might work well here. The BG and the backstop itself kind of run togather as is.', '2008-11-28 18:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088894, 741433, 33552, '<td valign="top">Get lower for this shot! It will make the bench apear larger, it will get the whole bridge to fit in the frame, and it may also minimize the bench''s shadow. Beautiful spot.</td>', 'Get lower for this shot! It will make the bench apear larger, it will get the whole bridge to fit in the frame, and it may also minimize the bench''s shadow. Beautiful spot.', '2008-11-28 18:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088896, 740512, 33552, '<td valign="top">Good job getting down and dirty with this angle! The saturation may be just the tiniest bit too much, but the colors <i>are</i> beautiful. Strong lines and great perspective.</td>', 'Good job getting down and dirty with this angle! The saturation may be just the tiniest bit too much, but the colors are beautiful. Strong lines and great perspective.', '2008-11-28 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088897, 740512, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge, gorgeous.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge, gorgeous.', '2008-11-28 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088898, 741416, 43774, '<td valign="top">So beautiful,  a sense of calm and peace in this photo.</td>', 'So beautiful,  a sense of calm and peace in this photo.', '2008-11-28 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088899, 740987, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a great POV</td>', 'What a great POV', '2008-11-28 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088900, 741248, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective.</td>', 'Very nice perspective.', '2008-11-28 18:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088902, 740557, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous sky.</td>', 'What a gorgeous sky.', '2008-11-28 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088903, 741438, 43774, '<td valign="top">A soft painterly feel to this, pretty.</td>', 'A soft painterly feel to this, pretty.', '2008-11-28 18:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088904, 741417, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very hidden. Gorgeous colours here.</td>', 'Very hidden. Gorgeous colours here.', '2008-11-28 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088905, 740888, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like it!!</td>', 'I like it!!', '2008-11-28 18:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088906, 741050, 43774, '<td valign="top">So beautiful, very nice.</td>', 'So beautiful, very nice.', '2008-11-28 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088908, 741397, 43774, '<td valign="top">I want to know what is written on that bench. A lovely scene.</td>', 'I want to know what is written on that bench. A lovely scene.', '2008-11-28 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088909, 741350, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the curve of the wall and the story this tells</td>', 'Love the curve of the wall and the story this tells', '2008-11-28 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088911, 741476, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful infrared photo. I almost wish you had taken this from a slightly higher perspective so the bench wasn''t blocking the water.</td>', 'Beautiful infrared photo. I almost wish you had taken this from a slightly higher perspective so the bench wasn''t blocking the water.', '2008-11-28 18:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088913, 741490, 43774, '<td valign="top">How soft and pretty.</td>', 'How soft and pretty.', '2008-11-28 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088915, 741355, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice and emotive.</td>', 'Very nice and emotive.', '2008-11-28 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088917, 741154, 43774, '<td valign="top">Such pretty soft pastels</td>', 'Such pretty soft pastels', '2008-11-28 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088920, 741480, 33552, '<td valign="top">The concept and execution work well together here, but the story is incomplete. There is an overall softness which, along with the deep mysterious shodows and intriguing colors, creates an appropriate mood. But there is no context. In a wider shot, cold and impersonal may work, but when I''m already this close I want to know more. A prop or other element may help to finish this shot.</td>', 'The concept and execution work well together here, but the story is incomplete. There is an overall softness which, along with the deep mysterious shodows and intriguing colors, creates an appropriate mood. But there is no context. In a wider shot, cold and impersonal may work, but when I''m already this close I want to know more. A prop or other element may help to finish this shot.', '2008-11-28 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088921, 739834, 43774, '<td valign="top">I usually hate extreme tilts but it really works here.</td>', 'I usually hate extreme tilts but it really works here.', '2008-11-28 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088922, 741228, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a cool bench, nice light.</td>', 'What a cool bench, nice light.', '2008-11-28 18:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088927, 741083, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, but does the encroaching darkness mean something? The sepia tone along with the shadows seeping in from above (an unnatural direction) and the extremely bold shapes and lines create an imposing, almost threatening, mood. A brighter (emotionally) scene may help to convey the discovery associated with art appreciation, but instead I question whether she is lost or otherwise in danger. Very dramatic, but I can''t determine your intention. I guess it may be the title that''s throwing me.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, but does the encroaching darkness mean something? The sepia tone along with the shadows seeping in from above (an unnatural direction) and the extremely bold shapes and lines create an imposing, almost threatening, mood. A brighter (emotionally) scene may help to convey the discovery associated with art appreciation, but instead I question whether she is lost or otherwise in danger. Very dramatic, but I can''t determine your intention. I guess it may be the title that''s throwing me.', '2008-11-28 18:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088929, 741323, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I like the how the tall trees contrast with the length(depth?) of the scene. I''d still like to see a little more to the right side (to accentuate the length/depth).</td>', 'Nice concept. I like the how the tall trees contrast with the length(depth?) of the scene. I''d still like to see a little more to the right side (to accentuate the length/depth).', '2008-11-28 18:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088931, 741259, 33552, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I just don''t see how the negative colors add anything here. Interesting patterns though.</td>', 'Yikes! I just don''t see how the negative colors add anything here. Interesting patterns though.', '2008-11-28 18:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088934, 741376, 14211, '<td valign="top">powerful</td>', 'powerful', '2008-11-28 18:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088936, 741007, 33552, '<td valign="top">The sky, water and snow play nicely off of each other here. Nice tonality, though I might consider burning in a bit under the bench. Looks like a peaceful spot.</td>', 'The sky, water and snow play nicely off of each other here. Nice tonality, though I might consider burning in a bit under the bench. Looks like a peaceful spot.', '2008-11-28 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088939, 741425, 33552, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the framing works here. Consider getting closer to emphasize the damage, or backing up and moving the subject off center to add context.</td>', 'I''m not sure the framing works here. Consider getting closer to emphasize the damage, or backing up and moving the subject off center to add context.', '2008-11-28 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088941, 741426, 33552, '<td valign="top">Is it HDR, sharpening or a transporter beam dematerializing the bench? Nice job getting an interesting perspective with strong lines, but the processing is a bit overdone.</td>', 'Is it HDR, sharpening or a transporter beam dematerializing the bench? Nice job getting an interesting perspective with strong lines, but the processing is a bit overdone.', '2008-11-28 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088948, 741378, 33552, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene, but the angle/composition is neither here nor there. Make a statement with perspective, get low, or high up, or close, or back up to add context.</td>', 'Interesting scene, but the angle/composition is neither here nor there. Make a statement with perspective, get low, or high up, or close, or back up to add context.', '2008-11-28 19:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088949, 741485, 33552, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting scene, but the centered comp adds nothing. Loose the lamppost on the right and tighten this up a bit.</td>', 'This is an interesting scene, but the centered comp adds nothing. Loose the lamppost on the right and tighten this up a bit.', '2008-11-28 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088950, 741317, 18197, '<td valign="top">Difficult subject with the high contrast. Well executed and an out-of-the-box bench! Way to go!</td>', 'Difficult subject with the high contrast. Well executed and an out-of-the-box bench! Way to go!', '2008-11-28 19:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088951, 741438, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Lovely setting. Nicely composed.', '2008-11-28 19:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088953, 741361, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting sculpture ... good capture.</td>', 'Interesting sculpture ... good capture.', '2008-11-28 19:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088955, 740639, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... bench is barely visible but you''ve caught the community that calls the bench home, at least for awhile. I like the triangular form created by the clock and the people.</td>', 'Interesting ... bench is barely visible but you''ve caught the community that calls the bench home, at least for awhile. I like the triangular form created by the clock and the people.', '2008-11-28 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088957, 741109, 33552, '<td valign="top">Among a sea of potentially exploitative street candids, this has a bit of interesting context. Thank you for deemphasizing the subject and adding an interesting scene. The framing from the trees along the top edge works well.</td>', 'Among a sea of potentially exploitative street candids, this has a bit of interesting context. Thank you for deemphasizing the subject and adding an interesting scene. The framing from the trees along the top edge works well.', '2008-11-28 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088958, 741444, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sort of a mundane bench, but you''ve made the most of it.</td>', 'Sort of a mundane bench, but you''ve made the most of it.', '2008-11-28 19:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088959, 741493, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pumpkin (squash?) is a nice touch. Makes an otherwise unremarkable bench more interesting.</td>', 'Pumpkin (squash?) is a nice touch. Makes an otherwise unremarkable bench more interesting.', '2008-11-28 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088965, 741234, 18197, '<td valign="top">The harsh winter light is tough to photograph in. I like the diagonal composition.</td>', 'The harsh winter light is tough to photograph in. I like the diagonal composition.', '2008-11-28 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088967, 741389, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The concept is immediately recognizable. It might not work at all, but I''d try cropping the top a bit. The buildings are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice. The concept is immediately recognizable. It might not work at all, but I''d try cropping the top a bit. The buildings are a bit distracting.', '2008-11-28 19:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088968, 740977, 18197, '<td valign="top">Classic bench in a classic setting. Well captured and presented.</td>', 'Classic bench in a classic setting. Well captured and presented.', '2008-11-28 19:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088971, 741478, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''d like to sit here for a spell. Feels peaceful.</td>', 'I''d like to sit here for a spell. Feels peaceful.', '2008-11-28 19:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088973, 740841, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view, good choice. B&amp;W works well here.</td>', 'Interesting point of view, good choice. B&W works well here.', '2008-11-28 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088976, 741476, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the wide format. The IR is well done, and works here. Just watch the tilted horizon.</td>', 'Nice use of the wide format. The IR is well done, and works here. Just watch the tilted horizon.', '2008-11-28 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088979, 741073, 18197, '<td valign="top">How interesting that that his (her?) head seems to be cut off. That plus the tilt lends some energy to this.</td>', 'How interesting that that his (her?) head seems to be cut off. That plus the tilt lends some energy to this.', '2008-11-28 19:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088983, 740839, 33552, '<td valign="top">This might work better if you got a bit closer and filled the frame with your subject. The periphery just dosen''t add much here.</td>', 'This might work better if you got a bit closer and filled the frame with your subject. The periphery just dosen''t add much here.', '2008-11-28 19:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088984, 741429, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well conceived, shot, and executed. Contrast between busy background and the simple lines of the bench is interesting. It feels a little sharp.</td>', 'Well conceived, shot, and executed. Contrast between busy background and the simple lines of the bench is interesting. It feels a little sharp.', '2008-11-28 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088987, 741398, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cool bench, but I''d like to see a more interesting angle.</td>', 'Cool bench, but I''d like to see a more interesting angle.', '2008-11-28 19:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088988, 739847, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of humor in this one :) Definitely an OOB shot.</td>', 'I like the sense of humor in this one :) Definitely an OOB shot.', '2008-11-28 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088990, 741200, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is great, and wildly different from many of the shots in the challenge. Feels more optimistic than the many dreary B&amp;W benches we''re seeing. Well done.</td>', 'This is great, and wildly different from many of the shots in the challenge. Feels more optimistic than the many dreary B&W benches we''re seeing. Well done.', '2008-11-28 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088992, 741218, 18197, '<td valign="top">What an unusual image! I like the curvature of the hill, and the tree as context for the bench. Not fond of the color cast, however.</td>', 'What an unusual image! I like the curvature of the hill, and the tree as context for the bench. Not fond of the color cast, however.', '2008-11-28 19:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088994, 741459, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting repeating pattern. But otherwise doesn''t hold my interest, sorry.</td>', 'Interesting repeating pattern. But otherwise doesn''t hold my interest, sorry.', '2008-11-28 19:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088996, 741398, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun take on the challenge. Thanks for brightening my day. Selective desat works well.</td>', 'This is such a fun take on the challenge. Thanks for brightening my day. Selective desat works well.', '2008-11-28 19:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5088999, 741014, 18197, '<td valign="top">A somber image ... the sadness almost palpable.</td>', 'A somber image ... the sadness almost palpable.', '2008-11-28 19:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089000, 740873, 33552, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful scene. This might be a good candidate for an HDR image. The blown out sky and underexposed land just take up too much space in this shot.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful scene. This might be a good candidate for an HDR image. The blown out sky and underexposed land just take up too much space in this shot.', '2008-11-28 19:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089003, 741456, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unusual perspective. Lens flair adds interest.</td>', 'Interesting and unusual perspective. Lens flair adds interest.', '2008-11-28 19:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089013, 740452, 18197, '<td valign="top">You really nailed the feeling of campus on a Fall Football Perfect day. Well done! And there''s even a bench here, although very subtle. The rapid fire voter may miss it.</td>', 'You really nailed the feeling of campus on a Fall Football Perfect day. Well done! And there''s even a bench here, although very subtle. The rapid fire voter may miss it.', '2008-11-28 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089017, 741430, 18197, '<td valign="top">The overall composition is pleasing but the subject doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'The overall composition is pleasing but the subject doesn''t hold my interest.', '2008-11-28 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089019, 741006, 18197, '<td valign="top">A workmanlike photo but I''m not resonating with the subject so much.</td>', 'A workmanlike photo but I''m not resonating with the subject so much.', '2008-11-28 19:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089021, 741314, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice. The subtle deviations from an otherwise symmetrical composition add to the beautifully disturbing ambiance.</td>', 'Nice. The subtle deviations from an otherwise symmetrical composition add to the beautifully disturbing ambiance.', '2008-11-28 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089022, 741307, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t mind sitting here for a spell. You''ve made a simple place attractive.</td>', 'Wouldn''t mind sitting here for a spell. You''ve made a simple place attractive.', '2008-11-28 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089026, 741088, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great example of a bench, in a great setting which shows it off. Colors are very good. Clarity is superb. Among best of show I think.</td>', 'Great example of a bench, in a great setting which shows it off. Colors are very good. Clarity is superb. Among best of show I think.', '2008-11-28 19:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089035, 741375, 18197, '<td valign="top">More of a guard rail than a bench I think. Sometimes we like a photo because it speaks to us of something personal ... a relationship perhaps, or a nostalgia ... and as a result the photo pleases us. Others without the connection or who don''t understand the context won''t "get it" or "feel it." That may be a problem for those voting on this.</td>', 'More of a guard rail than a bench I think. Sometimes we like a photo because it speaks to us of something personal ... a relationship perhaps, or a nostalgia ... and as a result the photo pleases us. Others without the connection or who don''t understand the context won''t "get it" or "feel it." That may be a problem for those voting on this.', '2008-11-28 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089036, 741435, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good bench, good comp, good technical execution.</td>', 'Good bench, good comp, good technical execution.', '2008-11-28 19:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089039, 741453, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like your "macro" approach to this bench. Unusual in this challenge so far.</td>', 'I like your "macro" approach to this bench. Unusual in this challenge so far.', '2008-11-28 19:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089040, 741110, 18197, '<td valign="top">Unusual take on the challenge. Creative. Good leading lines.</td>', 'Unusual take on the challenge. Creative. Good leading lines.', '2008-11-28 19:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089042, 740473, 18197, '<td valign="top">Photo is obviously less about the bench and more about the girl. Good composition. Unusual take on the challenge.</td>', 'Photo is obviously less about the bench and more about the girl. Good composition. Unusual take on the challenge.', '2008-11-28 19:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089043, 740557, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. I like pretty much everything here, but especially the way you captured the sky and the horizon.</td>', 'Lovely photo. I like pretty much everything here, but especially the way you captured the sky and the horizon.', '2008-11-28 19:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089045, 741011, 18197, '<td valign="top">The blown darks and lights certainly make this a dramatic photo. Few photos at DPC stir up strong emotion in me, but this one certainly did. Well done with that.</td>', 'The blown darks and lights certainly make this a dramatic photo. Few photos at DPC stir up strong emotion in me, but this one certainly did. Well done with that.', '2008-11-28 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089046, 741109, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the framing in the photo and the way you snuck the bench into the corner of the frame.</td>', 'I like the framing in the photo and the way you snuck the bench into the corner of the frame.', '2008-11-28 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089047, 741461, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the detail of the deck and the bench. Tone mapping isn''t over the top like we so often see.</td>', 'Nice capture of the detail of the deck and the bench. Tone mapping isn''t over the top like we so often see.', '2008-11-28 19:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089049, 740243, 18197, '<td valign="top">Mundane bench in a mundane setting, but you made the most of it.</td>', 'Mundane bench in a mundane setting, but you made the most of it.', '2008-11-28 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089052, 741033, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual perspective and the grain but the colors are too much for me.</td>', 'I like the unusual perspective and the grain but the colors are too much for me.', '2008-11-28 19:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089053, 741499, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but I''m not resonating with the subject much.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but I''m not resonating with the subject much.', '2008-11-28 19:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089054, 741355, 18197, '<td valign="top">Vignette does a nice job focusing my attention here. Nice touch. DOF works.</td>', 'Vignette does a nice job focusing my attention here. Nice touch. DOF works.', '2008-11-28 19:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089056, 741416, 18197, '<td valign="top">Like this. Colors are very good. Perspective is interesting. Sky highlights are dramatic. Not fond of the letterbox framing, however.</td>', 'Like this. Colors are very good. Perspective is interesting. Sky highlights are dramatic. Not fond of the letterbox framing, however.', '2008-11-28 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089059, 741417, 18197, '<td valign="top">So busy I can hardly find a place for my eye to rest ... oh wait, there''s a bench to hold on to. Well done!! Nice leading lines, too. Feels impressionistic.</td>', 'So busy I can hardly find a place for my eye to rest ... oh wait, there''s a bench to hold on to. Well done!! Nice leading lines, too. Feels impressionistic.', '2008-11-28 19:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089062, 740784, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is very dark and would benefit from more contrast I think.  Also the blue lighting seems unnatural.</td>', 'This is very dark and would benefit from more contrast I think.  Also the blue lighting seems unnatural.', '2008-11-28 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089066, 741341, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve been to this beautifu setting, sat on these benches. Although the photo meets the challenge, it doesn''t live up to my expectations of the place. Not sure shat to suggest to improve it. Possibly a different perspective.</td>', 'I''ve been to this beautifu setting, sat on these benches. Although the photo meets the challenge, it doesn''t live up to my expectations of the place. Not sure shat to suggest to improve it. Possibly a different perspective.', '2008-11-28 19:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089068, 741277, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very unusual take on the challenge. Love your angled presentation. Good work.</td>', 'Very unusual take on the challenge. Love your angled presentation. Good work.', '2008-11-28 19:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089070, 740784, 18197, '<td valign="top">On my calibrated monitor this is pretty dark.</td>', 'On my calibrated monitor this is pretty dark.', '2008-11-28 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089071, 741499, 44611, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a rather hurried snapshot.  The background is somewhat distracting to the subject and you may have benefited from cropping it out.  Also distracting are the bags in the foreground.</td>', 'This seems to be a rather hurried snapshot.  The background is somewhat distracting to the subject and you may have benefited from cropping it out.  Also distracting are the bags in the foreground.', '2008-11-28 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089072, 741500, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the symetry of this and the toning is perfect. Hope it does well in the voting.</td>', 'I love the symetry of this and the toning is perfect. Hope it does well in the voting.', '2008-11-28 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089074, 740615, 18197, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my poor Seahhawks ... the lost season. You really caught the disappointment of defeat. Well done.</td>', 'Reminds me of my poor Seahhawks ... the lost season. You really caught the disappointment of defeat. Well done.', '2008-11-28 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089076, 741007, 18197, '<td valign="top">Vry nice colors and contrast. Makes me want to sit a spell on this cold winter day.</td>', 'Vry nice colors and contrast. Makes me want to sit a spell on this cold winter day.', '2008-11-28 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089080, 741248, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not so sure about the title, but it''s a nice photo. The perspective over the bench to the church is inspired. Colors are nice. It looks like there might be some sharpening artifacts in the church outline.</td>', 'Not so sure about the title, but it''s a nice photo. The perspective over the bench to the church is inspired. Colors are nice. It looks like there might be some sharpening artifacts in the church outline.', '2008-11-28 19:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089081, 741089, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pleasant place to sit, especially in better weather. Good composition.</td>', 'Looks like a pleasant place to sit, especially in better weather. Good composition.', '2008-11-28 19:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089086, 741489, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looking and looking for a bench - sort of like "Where''s Waldo" - and not finding one. Otherwise a pleasing photo showing good mastery of your camera and editing software.</td>', 'Looking and looking for a bench - sort of like "Where''s Waldo" - and not finding one. Otherwise a pleasing photo showing good mastery of your camera and editing software.', '2008-11-28 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089088, 741228, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant example of an OOB bench. Well conceived, captured and presented. Leading lines are terrific.</td>', 'Brilliant example of an OOB bench. Well conceived, captured and presented. Leading lines are terrific.', '2008-11-28 19:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089090, 741425, 18197, '<td valign="top">Appropriate title but subject doesn''t make me want to linger. Just makes me sad.</td>', 'Appropriate title but subject doesn''t make me want to linger. Just makes me sad.', '2008-11-28 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089092, 740782, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. This perspective and subject have been done so often here they are nearly a cliche, but you''ve executed it flawlessly. Once again - Well Done!</td>', 'Well done. This perspective and subject have been done so often here they are nearly a cliche, but you''ve executed it flawlessly. Once again - Well Done!', '2008-11-28 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089093, 741452, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting title - the color of the bench clashes so much it conveys just the opposite of peace and quiet to me.</td>', 'Interesting title - the color of the bench clashes so much it conveys just the opposite of peace and quiet to me.', '2008-11-28 20:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089095, 741434, 18197, '<td valign="top">The blue supports give it a whimsical feeling which I like. Good detail, bordering on oversharp.</td>', 'The blue supports give it a whimsical feeling which I like. Good detail, bordering on oversharp.', '2008-11-28 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089096, 741310, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well focused bench and occupants along with the blurred background gives this an interesting feeling. It''s like these two are at the center of their own world and nothing much else matters.</td>', 'Well focused bench and occupants along with the blurred background gives this an interesting feeling. It''s like these two are at the center of their own world and nothing much else matters.', '2008-11-28 20:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089098, 741309, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fun ... I like how the bench frames the squirrel.</td>', 'Fun ... I like how the bench frames the squirrel.', '2008-11-28 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089099, 741376, 18197, '<td valign="top">Terrific! Among the best of show.</td>', 'Terrific! Among the best of show.', '2008-11-28 20:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089103, 741413, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great detail. Good colors. Highlights on the metal parts feel somewhat harsh.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great detail. Good colors. Highlights on the metal parts feel somewhat harsh.', '2008-11-28 20:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089107, 741400, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like that you included the dog. Softens an otherwise static subject and brings the photo to life.</td>', 'I like that you included the dog. Softens an otherwise static subject and brings the photo to life.', '2008-11-28 20:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089110, 741283, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and much about the photo generally. The tone mapping goes beyond my comfort zone. I''m a nut about tilt and generally prefer to see it eliminated ... but in this case I think it makes it more interesting than it would have been if straightened. Good choice.</td>', 'I like the subject and much about the photo generally. The tone mapping goes beyond my comfort zone. I''m a nut about tilt and generally prefer to see it eliminated ... but in this case I think it makes it more interesting than it would have been if straightened. Good choice.', '2008-11-28 20:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089112, 741480, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike photo. Good eye for the composition. Technicals are all good. But in the end, it doesn''t make me linger.</td>', 'Good workmanlike photo. Good eye for the composition. Technicals are all good. But in the end, it doesn''t make me linger.', '2008-11-28 20:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089114, 741378, 18197, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. I like the "totem" behind the bench. Warms up an otherwise dreary setting. Nice catch!</td>', 'Made me smile. I like the "totem" behind the bench. Warms up an otherwise dreary setting. Nice catch!', '2008-11-28 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089115, 741230, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. The face on the bench is superb. Diagonal composition is terrific. Among best of show.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. The face on the bench is superb. Diagonal composition is terrific. Among best of show.', '2008-11-28 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089117, 741154, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a nice place. Makes me want to sit a spell. Pastels seem peaceful.</td>', 'Nice capture of a nice place. Makes me want to sit a spell. Pastels seem peaceful.', '2008-11-28 20:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089120, 741266, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice bench and nice setting. I might have cropped it differently to move the bench to the left in the frame. That would deemphasize the shrubery which unbalances the image a bit IMO.</td>', 'Nice bench and nice setting. I might have cropped it differently to move the bench to the left in the frame. That would deemphasize the shrubery which unbalances the image a bit IMO.', '2008-11-28 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089123, 741259, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing chairs, but not a bench in sight. That said, it''s a lovely photo and among the best in show.</td>', 'I''m seeing chairs, but not a bench in sight. That said, it''s a lovely photo and among the best in show.', '2008-11-28 20:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089125, 740751, 18197, '<td valign="top">Boy does this composition ever lead me into the photo. Vry well done.</td>', 'Boy does this composition ever lead me into the photo. Vry well done.', '2008-11-28 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089130, 741323, 18197, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for a lovely photo. You really caught the quiet solitude of a snowy afternoon. Really really well done!</td>', 'Perfect title for a lovely photo. You really caught the quiet solitude of a snowy afternoon. Really really well done!', '2008-11-28 20:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089133, 741285, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s very good how you used highlihts to catch his face, the mug and the graphic on his shirt ... all of which combine to paint his reactions to life and the situation. I fear this may be under appreciated by voters. Hope not.</td>', 'It''s very good how you used highlihts to catch his face, the mug and the graphic on his shirt ... all of which combine to paint his reactions to life and the situation. I fear this may be under appreciated by voters. Hope not.', '2008-11-28 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089139, 741365, 18197, '<td valign="top">Diagonal trail does a nice job leading my eye into the photo. I like that you included the people in the deep background. High key treatment works for the most part but may not appeal broadly.</td>', 'Diagonal trail does a nice job leading my eye into the photo. I like that you included the people in the deep background. High key treatment works for the most part but may not appeal broadly.', '2008-11-28 20:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089142, 741161, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great human interest photo. Well captured and presented. Background feels a little over sharpened but it might just be the light.</td>', 'Great human interest photo. Well captured and presented. Background feels a little over sharpened but it might just be the light.', '2008-11-28 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089143, 741290, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty dark on my calibrated monitor.</td>', 'Pretty dark on my calibrated monitor.', '2008-11-28 20:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089145, 741369, 18197, '<td valign="top">Splendid setting. Superb composition and capture. Well edited. Neat sky texture. What''s not to like about this?</td>', 'Splendid setting. Superb composition and capture. Well edited. Neat sky texture. What''s not to like about this?', '2008-11-28 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089148, 741159, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject doesn''t make me want to linger but the composition makes the most of it. Strong diagonals rescue the subject somewhat.</td>', 'Subject doesn''t make me want to linger but the composition makes the most of it. Strong diagonals rescue the subject somewhat.', '2008-11-28 20:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089150, 741449, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike photo but the subject doesn''t hold me.</td>', 'Good workmanlike photo but the subject doesn''t hold me.', '2008-11-28 20:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089151, 741412, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workmanlike photo but the subject doesn''t hold me.</td>', 'Good workmanlike photo but the subject doesn''t hold me.', '2008-11-28 20:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089153, 741057, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. More upbeat and optimistic than many of the photos in this challenge. Thanks.</td>', 'Nicely done. More upbeat and optimistic than many of the photos in this challenge. Thanks.', '2008-11-28 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089154, 741490, 18197, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. Among the best in show. The horizontal bench among the strong verticals is great! High contrast is very appealing to me. Feels in some ways like a Japanese painting.</td>', 'Spectacular. Among the best in show. The horizontal bench among the strong verticals is great! High contrast is very appealing to me. Feels in some ways like a Japanese painting.', '2008-11-28 20:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089155, 741402, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well captured and presented. But the subject doesn''t hold me.</td>', 'Well captured and presented. But the subject doesn''t hold me.', '2008-11-28 20:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089156, 740839, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully presented. Really conveys an end-of-the-day feeling.</td>', 'Beautifully presented. Really conveys an end-of-the-day feeling.', '2008-11-28 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089159, 741440, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a fine photo, well captured and presented ... but diminished for me by the slanted lines. Maybe it was on a hill. Maybe it was on purpose. But I''d like it better straightened.</td>', 'This is a fine photo, well captured and presented ... but diminished for me by the slanted lines. Maybe it was on a hill. Maybe it was on purpose. But I''d like it better straightened.', '2008-11-28 20:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089161, 740512, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pleasing sunrise nicely framed by the bench. Your title says it all.</td>', 'Pleasing sunrise nicely framed by the bench. Your title says it all.', '2008-11-28 20:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089162, 741050, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely late afternoon. Conveys a sense of peace and makes me want to sit a spell.</td>', 'Lovely late afternoon. Conveys a sense of peace and makes me want to sit a spell.', '2008-11-28 20:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089163, 741445, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not getting the title, but the photo''s fine. I like the color and texture of the leaves, especially.</td>', 'Not getting the title, but the photo''s fine. I like the color and texture of the leaves, especially.', '2008-11-28 20:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089165, 741334, 18197, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. The slant of the bench makes it look like the bird is very heavy and the woman very light.</td>', 'Made me smile. The slant of the bench makes it look like the bird is very heavy and the woman very light.', '2008-11-28 20:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089167, 740483, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Like the sharp focus on the leaves in the near foreground. But otherwise the subject doesn''t make me want to linger.</td>', 'Well composed. Like the sharp focus on the leaves in the near foreground. But otherwise the subject doesn''t make me want to linger.', '2008-11-28 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089169, 741431, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic range here. Seagull''s placement in the frame is good. But the subject doesn''t make me want to linger.</td>', 'Good dynamic range here. Seagull''s placement in the frame is good. But the subject doesn''t make me want to linger.', '2008-11-28 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089172, 739834, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and presentation ... one of a kind I think. The simplicity of the bench is nicely juxtaposed with the busy background and foreground.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and presentation ... one of a kind I think. The simplicity of the bench is nicely juxtaposed with the busy background and foreground.', '2008-11-28 20:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089174, 741423, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this. Low key works well.</td>', 'I like the composition of this. Low key works well.', '2008-11-28 20:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089175, 741419, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not to pick on your photo which is nicely composed and conveys a good emotional payload, but I''m getting tired of dreary benches.</td>', 'Not to pick on your photo which is nicely composed and conveys a good emotional payload, but I''m getting tired of dreary benches.', '2008-11-28 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089178, 741498, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simple pleasing photo well captured and presented.</td>', 'Simple pleasing photo well captured and presented.', '2008-11-28 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089179, 740079, 18197, '<td valign="top">How interesting the framing here with the columns. Figures in silhouette are nice. Makes me speculate what they''re talking aobut.</td>', 'How interesting the framing here with the columns. Figures in silhouette are nice. Makes me speculate what they''re talking aobut.', '2008-11-28 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089182, 741335, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and light here. Is this Santa Maria del Carmine in Florence?</td>', 'Lovely colors and light here. Is this Santa Maria del Carmine in Florence?', '2008-11-28 20:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5089187, 741476, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, bright, optimistic photo. I was tiring of dreary benches and you breathed new life into my voting! It helps that it was beautifully imagined, captured and presented.</td>', 'Beautiful, bright, optimistic photo. I was tiring of dreary benches and you breathed new life into my voting! It helps that it was beautifully imagined, captured and presented.', '2008-11-28 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
