(5091829, 741332, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the sky could have been cropped about 30% and you know what''s coming... no real bench in view!</td>', 'Nice shot, the sky could have been cropped about 30% and you know what''s coming... no real bench in view!', '2008-11-30 19:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
