(5096400, 741228, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image. I love the curves, gold and copper tones, and the yin/yang composition.<br/> <br/>P.S. I just read your notes, and was very surprised to learn the bench is at a playground. It is so lovely that I thought it must be in a museum garden.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-01 23:33:24.</i></td>', 'What a beautiful image. I love the curves, gold and copper tones, and the yin/yang composition. P.S. I just read your notes, and was very surprised to learn the bench is at a playground. It is so lovely that I thought it must be in a museum garden.', '2008-12-01 23:30:15.000000', '2008-12-01 23:33:24.000000', 0),
