(5110159, 741334, 32997, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful pairing...great capture, have to say I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8860" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Imagineer</a> on this one about the crop being a bit too tight...<br/>nice eye, and take on challenge...</td>', 'what a wonderful pairing...great capture, have to say I agree with  Imagineer on this one about the crop being a bit too tight...nice eye, and take on challenge...', '2008-12-05 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
