(5266437, 741419, 68947, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think that the blurring of the background trees tends to fit perfectly with what has been portrayed in this shot.  This man''s world may well be a ''blur'' to him...or from one dream state to another, with everything blending in but his immediate surroundings since this is likely the only things that he feel connected to.  At that moment, his only connection is to the bench and his own belongings.  <br/> <br/>Out of the tons of photos in here that have this type of a theme, I really think that this one has depth.  Congrats on this capture!!!  Nicely done!!!</td>', 'Personally, I think that the blurring of the background trees tends to fit perfectly with what has been portrayed in this shot.  This man''s world may well be a ''blur'' to him...or from one dream state to another, with everything blending in but his immediate surroundings since this is likely the only things that he feel connected to.  At that moment, his only connection is to the bench and his own belongings.   Out of the tons of photos in here that have this type of a theme, I really think that this one has depth.  Congrats on this capture!!!  Nicely done!!!', '2009-02-20 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
